# Scripta CN 720 as an HSC aluminium machine: the stock frame (working area
# 700 x 430 mm, Z 200 mm, 210 kg), ball screws and SEW CMP40M servos on
# every axis, an ISO20 ATC spindle (~10 kg with its cylinder). Masses and
# stiffnesses are estimates, to be replaced with measurements (weigh the
# table, the carriage and the Z slide; tap-test the head and the bridge).
#
# 10 um linear scales on X, Y and Z, blended: the loops run on the
# resolvers, a correction low-passed over 0.2 s pulls them to the scales
# (blend.conf, fb_switch0.joint_tc).
include cn720_frame.inc
#
# Drives: config(s), sim lines, pitch [mm]
drive x cmp40m.conf,x.conf,scale10.conf,blend.conf sim.txt 10
drive y cmp40m.conf,y.conf,scale10.conf,blend.conf sim.txt 10
drive z cmp40m.conf,z.conf,scale10.conf,scale10z.conf,blend.conf sim.txt 5
brake z
rnoise x 1
rnoise y 1
rnoise z 1
scale x 10
scale y 10
scale z 10
